To hit this API gateway, you need AWS sig4 auth and you need to be me. Recent curl versions can do it:

```
curl --aws-sigv4 "aws:amz:us-east-2:execute-api" \
  --user "$AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID:$AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY" \
  -H "x-amz-security-token: $AWS_SESSION_TOKEN" \
  -X POST \
  https://<CHECK-WORKSPACE-OUTPUT>.execute-api.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/development/handler
```


To find the exact URL, check the workspace outputs.
